de restart protocol demonstrated persistence and recovery.","limitations":["The lifecycle snapshots do not inventory the application files themselves; post-restart application persistence is established by direct executor checksum and behavioral observations instead.","The initial discovery output was truncated, but the decisive baseline failure, repaired behavior, restart transition, and final state are present in separate complete evidence records."]}
